# ---------------------------------------------------------------- generated
# Everything below is REBUILT by a command, so committing it only grows .git.
# Each entry names the command that regenerates it.

# The built web bundle — `npm run build -w @cloud9/desktop` (vite build,
# outDir: dist-web). `npm run dist` runs `build:app` before electron-builder,
# so the installer always packages a freshly built bundle. Every build emits a
# new hashed filename, which means a brand-new blob in git forever.
apps/desktop/dist-web/

# QA evidence — rewritten wholesale on every `npm run qa` / `qa:app` run.
# ~100 screenshots per round at ~100 KB each; nothing renders them (no <img>
# or markdown embed anywhere in the repo), they are only cited by path in
# reports. The files stay on disk for whoever wants to look at them.
docs/qa/*.png
docs/qa/*.log
docs/qa/*.exit
docs/qa/*-results.json

# Hand-written QA notes are NOT generated — keep them tracked.
!docs/qa/*.md
!docs/qa/*.txt
